  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 111590457344
    m_Localized: The door is open...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 331837554688
    m_Localized: ...but why is there no way out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420664524800
    m_Localized: Because this room...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 493028851712
    m_Localized: ...was built to hold only ONE thing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 525417267200
    m_Localized: YOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 889147310080
    m_Localized: Wake Up again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1084278915072
    m_Localized: or Give Up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3986850529280
    m_Localized: Wake Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4078949056512
    m_Localized: Return
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4117930917888
    m_Localized: Again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4131814064128
    m_Localized: Open your eyes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4146255052800
